    {
      "file": "scripture-habit/src/components/seo-manager.tsx",
      "description": "For maximum app privacy, we explicitly prevent search crawlers from indexing private app pages (such as dashboard, signup, or profile settings) by appending a dynamic 'noindex, nofollow' directive to the robots meta element.",
      "line": 54
    },
    {
      "file": "scripture-habit/src/components/seo-manager.tsx",
      "description": "Similarly, we dynamically inject Open Graph (og:title, og:description, og:site_name) and Twitter cards description anchors, using localized resources mapped from active translation bundles.",
      "line": 82
    },
    {
      "file": "scripture-habit/src/components/seo-manager.tsx",
      "description": "Lastly, to avoid duplicate content flags across different search engine crawlers, we programmatically compile a fully qualified absolute canonical link tag (e.g. mapping locale prefixes into 'https://scripturehabit.app/ja/...').",
